dd it when you need it):"},"472":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-62","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#embedding-configuration","content":"Set the API key via the environment; if it is unset, semantic search is silently skipped:"},"473":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-63","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#pointing-at-a-different-endpoint","content":"`skill-project.toml` is committed and shared by everyone on the project, so it is\nthe wrong place to record that *your* machine — or one CI job — talks to a\ndifferent embedding endpoint. Both non-secret fields can be overridden from the\nenvironment, and the environment wins:"},"474":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-64","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#pointing-at-a-different-endpoint","content":"Variable"},"475":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-65","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#pointing-at-a-different-endpoint","content":"Overrides"},"476":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-66","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#pointing-at-a-different-endpoint","content":"Example"},"477":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-67","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#pointing-at-a-different-endpoint","content":"`OPENAI_BASE_URL`"},"478":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-68","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#pointing-at-a-different-endpoint","content":"`openai_base_url`"},"479":{"id":"/configuration/init-command-69","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/configuration/init-command#pointing-at-a-different-endpoint","content":"`https://gateway.interna