ble","content":"unset (CPU core count)"},"2085":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-53","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Max concurrent trials for one case."},"2086":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-54","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"`pass_threshold`"},"2087":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-55","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"float"},"2088":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-56","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"no"},"2089":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-57","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"`1.0`"},"2090":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-58","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Fraction of trials that must pass for a case to be marked passed; validated to `[0.0, 1.0]` (`EVAL_INVALID_THRESHOLD` otherwise)."},"2091":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-59","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"`fail_on_missing_agent`"},"2092":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-60","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"bool"},"2093":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-61","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"no"},"2094":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-62","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"**`true`**"},"2095":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-63","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"If true, `eval run` and `eval validate --agent <key>` error with `EVAL_AGENT_UNAVAILABLE` when the chosen agent isn't installed."},"2096":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-64","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"**Defaults verified against source** (`crates/fastskill-core/src/core/manifest.rs::EvalConfigToml`): `timeout_seconds` defaults to **900**, and `fail_on_missing_agent` defaults to **true** — the CLI refuses to run against a missing agent unless you explicitly set it to `false`. Don't assume otherwise from older examples."},"2097":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-65","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"With no `checks` file configured, each case still receives the required skill-consultation expectation implied by `should_trigger`. A successful process exit alone is not enough. Add a checks file for further deterministic outcome or adherence evidence."},"2098":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-66","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#validate-the-config","content":"Real output against a working config (this one set `timeout_seconds = 120` and `fail_on_missing_agent = false`):"},"2099":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-67","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#validate-the-config","content":"(`parallel: 0` here just means \"unset\" in the table renderer — the runner still falls back to CPU core count.) A broken `checks.toml` fails validation immediately, e.g.:"},"2100":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-68","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#validate-the-config","content":"A prompts CSV missing a required column fails the same way:"},"2101":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-69","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"The suite loader (`aikit-evals::suite`) reads a header row with **required** columns `id`, `prompt`, `should_trigger`, plus optional `tags` and `workspace_subdir`."},"2102":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-70","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Column"},"2103":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-71","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Required"},"2104":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-72","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Meaning"},"2105":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-73","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"`id`"},"2106":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-74","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"yes"},"2107":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-75","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Non-empty identifier per row. Used for `--case`, artifact folder names, and reports."},"2108":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-76","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"`prompt`"},"2109":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-77","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"yes"},"2110":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-78","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Text sent to the agent. Use CSV quoting (`\"...\"`, doubled `\"\"` for an embedded quote) for commas or newlines."},"2111":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-79","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"`should_trigger`"},"2112":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-80","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"yes"},"2113":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-81","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"`true`/`1` (case-insensitive `true`) or anything else counts as `false`. It creates a required per-case skill-consultation expectation; see below."},"2114":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-82","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"`tags`"},"2115":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-83","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"no"},"2116":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-84","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Comma-separated tags inside the cell (e.g. `\"smoke,basic\"`). Used by `eval run --tag <name>`."},"2117":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-85","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"`workspace_subdir`"},"2118":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-86","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"no"},"2119":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-87","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Relative path that becomes the agent's working directory for the case. Under the default isolation it is created **inside the case's scratch workspace**, with fixture files copied in from the same path under the project root; under `--no-isolation` it resolves directly under the project root. Empty or omitted → workspace root."},"2120":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-88","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"Empty lines are skipped."},"2121":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-89","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"**`should_trigger` affects pass/fail.** The engine creates an implicit required `skill_invoked` check for each case, with `expected` equal to the CSV value. An explicit `skill_invoked` check that applies to the case replaces the implicit one; `eval validate` rejects a contradictory polarity. Therefore `false` tests non-consultation and `true` tests consultation, subject to the selected backend's observability."},"2122":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-90","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#2-the-prompts-csv","content":"This is adherence/selection evidence, not outcome correctness. A structured `Skill` call is direct evidence; supported decoders may also recognize a tool input that references the staged skill-document path. The path proxy indicates consultation, not that the instructions were read or followed. Pair positive cases with outcome checks or judges."},"2123":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-91","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#3-checks-checkstoml-optional","content":"Point `checks` at a TOML file with one or more `[[check]]` tables, keyed by the required `name` field. There are exactly five check types (`aikit_evals::checks::CheckDefinition`):"},"2124":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-92","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#3-checks-checkstoml-optional","content":"**Checks score the canonical trace, never raw stdout.** Every check below matches against the run's `trace.jsonl` — the parsed, structured event stream. Raw stdout is deliberately excluded: with the `claude` agent it opens with a `system`/`project init` event listing **every skill installed in the environment**, which used to make any skill-name pattern pass vacuously. Assistant text still reaches the trace as message events, so matching on what the agent actually said continues to work."},"2125":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-93","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"The check you almost certainly want for \"did my skill fire?\"."},"2126":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-94","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"Field"},"2127":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-95","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"Type"},"2128":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-96","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"Required"},"2129":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-97","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"Default"},"2130":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-98","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"`skill`"},"2131":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-99","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"string"},"2132":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-100","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"no"},"2133":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-101","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"— (omit to match *any* skill invocation)"},"2134":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-102","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"`expected`"},"2135":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-103","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"bool"},"2136":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-104","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"no"},"2137":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-105","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"`true` (`false` asserts the skill did **not** run)"},"2138":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-106","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"`required`"},"2139":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-107","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"bool"},"2140":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-108","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"no"},"2141":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-109","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"`true`"},"2142":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-110","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"`cases`"},"2143":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-111","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"string array"},"2144":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-112","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"no"},"2145":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-113","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"all cases (exact case IDs)"},"2146":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-114","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#skill_invoked","content":"Matches a structured `Skill` invocation or, where the decoder supplies it, a tool input referri