 the history table first, then pick the step you care about — the\nlargest positive delta, or the last accepted step before a regression:"},"2606":{"id":"/optimize/results-40","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#finding-a-step-to-inspect","content":"An empty table under a completed run means no training steps were recorded — see the\nzero-step warning in Running and monitoring."},"2607":{"id":"/optimize/results-41","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#export-the-best-skill","content":"When you're happy with the results, export the best skill document:"},"2608":{"id":"/optimize/results-42","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#export-the-best-skill","content":"This copies `best_skill.md` from the run directory to the destination path. Parent\ndirectories are created if they don't exist."},"2609":{"id":"/optimize/results-43","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#export-the-best-skill","content":"**Note:** `best_skill.md` is the highest-scoring skill document seen across all accepted\nsteps — not necessarily the final step. If the last few steps were rejected, it reflects the\nbest earlier checkpoint. A run where nothing was accepted exports the seed document, with\nthe optimizer's protected-region markers added."},"2610":{"id":"/optimize/results-44","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#artifacts-reference","content":"Each step directory (`<run>/steps/step_{NNNN}/`) contains:"},"2611":{"id":"/optimize/results-45","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#artifacts-reference","content":"File"},"2612":{"id":"/optimize/results-46","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/optimize/results#artifacts-reference","content":"Description"},"2613":{"id":"/optimize/results-47","page_id":"/optimize/results","tags":[],"t