ng rules that score each response. &#x2A;(Optional, but without it there is no real grading signal — see below.)*"],[2541,"**Checks**"],[2889,"**Checksum Verification**: All downloads include SHA256 checksums"],[2864,"**cksum**: SHA256 checksum of the ZIP artifact"],[2297,"**Claude Code doesn't see a skill:** Confirm it is installed with `fastskill skill list`, and that\nthe skills directory contains a valid `SKILL.md` for it. `fastskill skill read <skill-id>` should\nprint its content."],[222,"**CLI**: single entry point for installs, checks, search, and evals."],[3131,"**Commit `skill-project.toml` and `skills.lock`.**"],[369,"**Commit project lock to git**:"],[1275,"**Content**: Metadata and embeddings used by semantic search"],[1278,"**Content**: Per-skill file hashes used to decide which skills changed since the last run"],[431,"**Context detection**: `project init` detects whether you're in a skill directory or a project root:"],[2996,"**Converts to internal format** for processing by:"],[365,"**Create the directory manually**:"],[806,"**Creates File**: Writes `skill-project.toml` with basic structure and commented examples"],[2328,"**Cursor doesn't see a skill**"],[468,"**Custom**: any path you pass via `--skills-dir` or the prompt"],[467,"**Default**: `.claude/skills`"],[1238,"**Default**: Shows a live progress bar with completion percentage (when stdout is a TTY)"],[2096,"**Defaults verified against source** (`crates/fastskill-core/src/core/manifest.rs::EvalConfigToml`): `timeout_seconds` defaults to **900**, and `fail_on_missing_agent` defaults to **true** — the CLI refuses to run against a missing agent unless you explicitly set it to `false`. Don't assume otherwise from older examples."],[2863,"**deps**: Dependencies (currently empty, reserved for future use)"],[797,"**Detects Context**: Determines if you're in a skill directory (with SKILL.md) or a project directory"],[225,"**Developers**: install, list, read, search for what agents load."],[954,"**Deve