],[2796,"**Keyword fallback otherwise.** If no embedding provider is configured, semantic ranking silently\nskips and resolution falls back to keyword matching — the endpoint still returns results, it just\nranks them without embeddings."],[338,"**Kill the conflicting process**:"],[1282,"**Large repositories** (1000+ skills): 10-30 minutes"],[2867,"**links**: Reserved for future use"],[361,"**Linux/macOS**: `~/.config/fastskill/global-skills.lock`"],[942,"**Loads Dependencies**: Reads `[dependencies]` section from `skill-project.toml`"],[2323,"**Loads the full `SKILL.md`** for relevant skills to get instructions and parameters —\nthe same content `fastskill skill read <skill-id>` prints."],[3058,"**Local catalog**: skill content and catalog metadata on disk."],[2798,"**Local vector index.** Skill embeddings are stored in a local SQLite vector index (path set by\n`index_path` under `[tool.fastskill.embedding]`), so resolution queries run against on-disk vectors\nwith no external service call at query time."],[1381,"**local**: Local filesystem path"],[941,"**Locates Project File**: Finds `skill-project.toml` at project root or walks up directory tree"],[2322,"**Matches task requirements** against each skill's `description` frontmatter."],[2333,"**MCP access** — register the FastSkill MCP server for tool-based access inside Cursor"],[1281,"**Medium repositories** (100 skills): 2-5 minutes"],[2861,"**name**: Skill identifier"],[1269,"**Network Issues**: Check internet connectivity"],[3129,"**Never commit plaintext tokens.** Keep them in your shell profile, CI secret store, or a secrets\nmanager. Commit `skill-project.toml`; keep the token value out of the repo."],[731,"**Not-observable checks.** A check whose evidence the backend cannot produce records `passed: false` for older readers. It is excluded rather than counted as a failure."],[2447,"**Note on `aggregate_group_size` and `gate_trials`:** unlike the other numeric fields, these two\nare not checked by `fastskill`